	abstract = {Accompanied by the rapid development of computer science and technology, artificial intelligence (face recognition, licence plate recognition, violation recognition) technology has been widely used in electric power intelligent construction sites.The AI analysis system integrates a variety of terminal equipment at electric power operation sites, realizes comprehensive control of risky operations, and shifts from human to technological prevention. Although AI technology is increasingly widely used in electric power intelligent construction sites, however, due to the system's need to access a large number of Internet of Things(IoT) terminal devices, the low computing power of edge computing devices, and the wide variety of construction scenarios, the AI system is facing a number of security problems. From cloud computing to edge computing and then to the terminal equipment, the implementation of end-to-end protection, all-round protection of terminal equipment, edge computing device access security, and enhance its ability to resist a variety of security threats is a prerequisite for the development of the application of AI technology in the intelligent construction site. In this paper, a security solution for artificial intelligence technology in the application of electric power intelligent site is proposed, and it has been implemented in the construction of eight intelligent sites in the transmission and transformation project of Inner Mongolia Power Grid, and the system integrates a large number of terminal devices of different specifications from different manufacturers in accordance with the architecture of the cloud-network edge, and the system operates stably and reliably. The three-in-one technology of IOT access authentication, edge verification authentication and cloud authorisation authentication has applied for and obtained an invention patent. © 2024 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.},
