	abstract = {Ensuring sensitive data security is critical in the ever changing world of cloud computing. This paper offers an overview of our all-encompassing security protocols, created to tackle the ever-changing demands of contemporary information ecosystems. Proposed approach starts with a strong encryption architecture that uses the most recent algorithms to protect data while it's in transit and at rest. We proactively identify and neutralise such attacks before they have a chance to jeopardise the integrity of the cloud environment by utilizing sophisticated AI-driven anomaly detection. A proactive approach to addressing new security threats is ensured by this real-time threat mitigation. A multi-layered authentication and access control system that customises rights depending on user roles and responsibilities is another feature of Empowering Data Defender. By using this granular approach, sensitive material is protected from unauthorised access and only authorised workers can interact with it. Project approach includes regular security audits and compliance inspections to make sure that industry standard and laws are followed. In addition to strengthening the present security posture, this ongoing monitoring and assessment procedure allows for quick adaptability to changing compliance needs. Encouraging Data Defender's all-encompassing security approach fortifies cloud-based data, fostering confidence and trust in the digital age. Through the integration of access control, intrusion prevention, encryption, and compliance measures, our methodology provides a holistic resolution to the complex problems presented by contemporary cloud systems © 2024 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.},
	author_keywords = {Cloud Data; Data Protection; Multi-layered Authentication.; Security},
