	affiliations = {SASTRA Deemed University, Department of Electronics and Communication Engineering, Thanjavur, India},
	abstract = {Based on the survey conducted among the students, it is found that there is a necessity for students to easily figure out their required GPA (Grade Point Average) in a reliable way. For which calculating GPA can be a time-consuming process. To overcome this, developing a responsive authenticated and authorized web application for estimating GPA is necessary. In this project Front End languages like CSS (Cascading Style Sheets), HTML (Hyper Text Markup Language), Java Script, Bootstrap are used to design the client-side signup webpage. The web portal is provided with two step verification during signup. After submission of signup, one-time password authentication is provided based on the input given by the user. Meanwhile in the server side, Django is employed to store the user details. Django is a high-level python web framework that enables rapid development of secure and maintainable websites. After successful authentication, User is then redirected to the login page which is designed using Front-End languages. Now User is all set to sign-in to the web page. When login is accomplished, the main webpage of the application comes into play. The webpage contains SGPA (Semester Grade Point Average) calculation and Student academic welfare details. In the Back-End, the required calculations are made regarding CGPA (Cumulative Grade Point Average). This application is designed for students' academic welfare to easily calculate their required SGPA to obtain their dream CGPA. This application can help in saving time. © 2023 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.},
